  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Road Safety Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the number of road deaths and serious accidents in developing countries by supporting a World Bank Multi-donor trust fund (MDTF) to improve the evidence on what works to improve road safety outcomes and underpins GRSF key focus areas around safe infrastructure; safe speed; safe road users and emergency medical services and post-crash care. The MDTF provides funding, knowledge, and technical assistance to scale-up the countries&#x2019; efforts to build their scientific, technological, managerial and delivery capacities for road safety.</narrative>
  </description>
